## Super-Heavy Weapon System
## Popup shown when a character without enough SPECIAL Strength or power armor tries to wield or fire a super-heavy weapon

super-heavy-weapon-too-weak = This weapon is far too heavy for you to handle. You need exceptional strength or powered armor to operate it.

## Popup shown when the wearer of the .50 HMG ammo backpack tries to load ammo into it
hmg-backpack-cannot-self-load = You cannot feed your own ammunition backpack. Ask a friend!

## Item slot on the .50 HMG ammo backpack that cradles the machine gun
hmg-pack-gun-slot-name = .50 HMG cradle
hmg-pack-gun-insert-verb = Stow HMG
hmg-pack-gun-eject-verb = Unstow HMG
